This project uses the Penn-Fudan Pedestrian Detection and Segmentation Dataset.

The dataset contains:

170 pedestrian images.

345 annotated pedestrian instances.

RGB images.

Pixel-level pedestrian segmentation masks.

Annotations that can be used to derive bounding boxes.

Dataset Download

PennFudanPed Dataset – Kaggle

Original Penn-Fudan Dataset – University of Pennsylvania

The dataset contains three main directories:

PennFudanPed/

├── PNGImages/       # Original pedestrian images
├── PedMasks/        # Instance segmentation masks
└── Annotation/      # Image annotations
